  abilityDesc: 30 combo massive Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), enormously boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts Spark damage
    for 3 turns,  considerably boosts own Spark damage for 3 turns & high probable
    resistance against 1 KO attack
